{"parse": {"title": "冰原时隙-06", "pageid": 107413, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99-05\" title=\"冰原时隙-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">冰原时隙-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%99-07\" title=\"冰原时隙-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">冰原时隙</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E6.AC.A1.E8.83.8C.E5.8F.9B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一次背叛\">一次背叛</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一次背叛</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Betrayal</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>距离安德烈小队失联三十四个小时。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>准确地说，距离安德烈小队失联三十六个小时，还剩一小时十七分钟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>注意隐蔽，嚼嚼松果先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>松鼠不得不把自己花花绿绿的尾巴插进雪堆里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我也希望我能隐蔽，就像章鱼那样擅长，一到南极就自己变成白色的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>你知道吗中尉，杰克老弟就会这么做冻鱼——把鱼抓起来，然后插进雪里，就像这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-312113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-312113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-312113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……冻鱼？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>要是能回去的话，我一定得请你尝尝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>小心！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雪堆被神秘术的光环炸碎，幸好松鼠已经被莫莉德尔拎在了手上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-311512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我的老天……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-503201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-503201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-503201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑信徒：</div><div>ㄕˊ　ㄇㄜ˙　ㄖㄣˊ　ㄗㄞˋ　ㄋㄚˋ　ㄌㄧˇ</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>安德烈？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>中尉，太好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>安德烈，你的脸上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>中尉，他戴着面具！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我看到了……我看到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>中尉，你也终于觉醒了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>复苏之母的感召在这里越发清晰，我已通过考验。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>加入我们吧，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>安德烈……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>等等，你们认识？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>那都是错误的，是谎言，被篡改了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>你们都受骗了，都是谎言，唯有……唯有复苏之母才掌握着真相！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>其他人呢？戴维德在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>戴维德？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-517201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>他还没能通过试炼，但我会帮助他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>我会帮助所有人……复苏之母会救我们所有人！中尉，你难道不想要那个属于神秘学家的真相吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>你背叛了将军，安德烈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>中尉，跟我一起走吧！戴维德也将投入复苏之母的怀抱，他会被照顾得很好，复苏之母将疗愈一切！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>谎言蒙蔽了他们的双眼，他们都不明白！只有投向复苏之母的怀抱，神秘学家才有未来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>那是真正的神明！幸运的是伊戈尔将军看清了这一点，所以我们才会从芝诺离开——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉的枪口飘出硝烟味的白雾，安德烈低头看着自己脚边的弹孔，困惑不解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>这是警告，下次我不会再打偏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉的胸口剧烈起伏着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>你背叛了你的信念和荣誉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>从芝诺离开？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>嘿，中尉，你得给我一个解释！你怎么和面具怪人这么熟？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我很抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉看着安德烈脸上的面具，粘稠的黑色从他眼眶中滚落，像是虔诚的信徒在神座下涌出热泪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她闭了闭眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>嚼嚼松果先生，请听我说。我会就这一切给出合理的解释，但不是现在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>更多的重塑信徒正包围过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>他们人太多了，我们必须暂时撤离。左后方是包围圈的破绽，你来指路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>嘿，你都把我搞糊涂了！你们不是一伙儿的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我数到三，你来指路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>中尉，亲眼目睹神迹都不能使你信服吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>让我信服的另有其人，比起高悬的浮夸神明，我已为自己选定了愿意托付生命的指导者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-517202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div>即使他也已经匍匐在了神座下？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉摇了摇头，给出指向不明的坚决否定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-312111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>三。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一把抓住松鼠，敏捷地跃出包围圈。神秘术在她脚边炸开，弄脏了亘古纯白的冰原。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在南极穿行专家的指导下，他们顺利摆脱了重塑的围追堵截，并绕回了原定汇合点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>中尉，怎么样，有消息了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>坏消息是还没有找到戴维德，但应该能确定大致的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>这已经是好消息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>还有更坏的消息，我找到了安德烈小队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>安德烈是最忠诚勇敢的战士，有什么不幸发生在了他们身上？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉深深吸气，像是在组织语言。正焦躁地用后脚拍打地面的松鼠毫不留情地替她说出了真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>没有不幸，老兄。我得说你们的伙伴开心极了——他戴着面具，满脸流油，神神叨叨得像是亲眼见到了圣母降临！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>……面具？安德烈？这不可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即便坚决否定，变得铁青的脸色和剧烈起伏的胸膛仍然暴露了他的动摇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉没能给出否定的回答，她对队长的期待回以近乎悲伤的叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我很遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>只有安德烈吗？还是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>除了戴维德以外的所有……我不确定戴维德情况好不好，但据说他“还没有”通过试炼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>我们还来得及挽救他对吗？我申请现在就进行行动，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉做了个深呼吸，对抗来自队长的激烈的情绪感染。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>冷静点，队长。我们需要周详的作战计划，这也是为了戴维德负责……我不认为我们会有第二次机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>是，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>但前期的准备工作总是必要的，不要觉得焦躁或无能为力，我们能做的还有很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-525601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白手套队长：</div><div>……呼，我明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>队长调整了一下情绪，转身离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在，只有中尉和她愤怒的松鼠朋友被留在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我猜，现在该轮到我得到解释了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>这太可怕、太卑鄙了，中尉。我简直难以相信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>为什么一开始的时候你没告诉我，你们跟面具怪人居然是一伙的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉看起来呼吸困难，她几乎是本能地反驳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……不，我们不是一伙的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>这要是真的可就太好了，中尉。不然我可真不知道该怎么面对你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我一直都把你当做朋友，我以为咱们已经是一伙儿的了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我很愿意相信你，但你们聊得可真开心。能不能稍微解释一下这个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉很少露出这样难看的脸色，上一次或许还是因为圣保罗的大雨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她徒劳地试图辩解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我们只是有些暂时合作……为了拯救很多人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>噢，不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>那你们不就是<span style=\"font-size:116%\"><b>一伙儿</b></span>的吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>……对不起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我无心欺骗。我只是一直没有找到合适的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>这毫无疑问就是欺骗，中尉，这是绝对的欺骗。我可不是什么刚睁开眼的小松鼠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我们一起走过了那么多路，我们并肩作战，你难道没有一分钟的时间觉得，你应该告诉我真相吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中尉扇动眼睫，那是从未像今日这么沉重的一双蝴蝶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>你为什么不在一开始的时候告诉我呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>“嘿，松果，很抱歉，我们现在不得不跟面具怪人有些合作，但这是为了救人！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>你怎么知道我不会接受！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我想……这并不是因为我不信任你，我只是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她努力地感受自己的嘴唇，它们冰冷粗糙得像是被南极的低温冻住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我不接受。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_yongbao\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_yongbao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_yongbao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>珍藏的合照紧贴着胸口。她闭上眼，看见了一团橘红色的幻火。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_duizhi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_duizhi\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_duizhi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-2_2_at_duizhi.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_duizhi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-2_2_at_duizhi.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_duizhi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/Cg-2_2_at_duizhi.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_duizhi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_luopeila.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_luopeila\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_luopeila\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-2_2_at_luopeila.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_luopeila.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-2_2_at_luopeila.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_luopeila.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-2_2_at_luopeila.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_luopeila.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_yingdi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_yingdi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我没有告诉你，是因为我不接受。我为此感到羞耻，即使这羞耻有违我接到的命令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我……我很抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是嚼嚼松果收到过最悲伤的歉意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">嚼嚼松果：</div><div>我可以接受你的道歉……但我退出，中尉。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "冰原时隙-06"}}